{"title": "Shadow", "pageid": 2073, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The word <b>Shadow</b> primarily refers to a parallel universe that is created or cast by the metaphysically polar world of <a href=\"/wiki/Amber\" title=\"Amber\">Amber</a>. Amber is said to cast an infinite number of shadows with each shadow differing more the further from Amber you traverse, all the way to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Courts_of_Chaos\" title=\"The Courts of Chaos\">Chaos</a>. Our <a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Earth</a> is but one shadow of Amber.\n</p><p>Any sufficiently powerful entity or object, if it dwells within a Shadow universe long enough, also has the potential to cast lesser Shadows of itself into adjacent parallel universes. This occurred when <a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin</a> spent a prolonged period of time in a Shadow universe called <span class=\"new\" title=\"Avalon (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXZhbG9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Avalon</span>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Shadow?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260425124137\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 321/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.23